# muyu, iPadOS 27 line (24A446) — the device layer of the XNU patch series.
#
# Same shape as the 17 line: one directory holds this line's patches, and the order is the
# filename order, so the list below is the directory listing and nothing else. What differs is
# only how the framework reads it — a schema_version 1 board (the 17 line) globs
# patches/xnu/*.patch, a schema_version 2 board (this line) needs the list written out.
# scripts/audit-27-config.py enforces that this file and `ls *.patch` agree.
#
# The arch, soc and os layers are NOT copied in here. board.toml references them by
# prefix (arch:patches/xnu/series, soc:patches/xnu-12377/series, os:patches/xnu/series) and the
# framework resolves each into its own checkout, exactly as UniXNU-uke does. An earlier version of
# this file pasted all 67 framework patches in as absolute paths; that is why it drifted from the
# framework without anyone noticing.
#
# Archived under patches/xnu/ instead: the 16 patches that make up the 17 line's screen stack
# (video console, last-panic replay, watchdog policy, hold-reboot). They are not inputs to a
# 27-line kernel — the 27 line has no STACK64 and no muyu_vc_* (docs/SCREEN-ONLY.md §3) — and they
# must stay in patches/xnu/ because that glob is how a 17-line build finds them.

muyu-console-clear.patch
muyu-source-storage-start.patch
native-stack-shift.patch
offline-no-iortc-wait.patch
